So, here's my take...and why Microsoft and OpenAI are missing the big big.

@satyanadella's Reverse Rnformation Paradox is a smart essay. But I'd push back on one word, and it's the word doing all the work. That word is intelligence.

👉We keep calling this the intelligence age and I understand why.

